1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,303
Ren: If you hear screaming above you,
don't go up.

2
00:00:02,973 --> 00:00:06,241
VALE & SON DISPATCH: The Quiet Hand. Part
one of ten: hour zero.

3
00:00:06,561 --> 00:00:09,771
Ren: Six hours earlier. Job fourteen.

4
00:00:10,441 --> 00:00:12,624
Ren: Six rats. Easy money.

5
00:00:13,294 --> 00:00:14,725
Ren: Then the screaming started.

6
00:00:15,395 --> 00:00:18,546
Ren: Above me. Rats do not scream.

7
00:00:19,216 --> 00:00:21,430
Ren: Listen first. Look second.

8
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:22,831
Ren: One.

9
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:24,677
Ren: Two.

10
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:26,665
Ren: Three.

11
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:30,666
Ren: Three moves. That is all anyone
needs.

12
00:00:31,336 --> 00:00:32,667
Ren: Then my phone buzzed.

13
00:00:33,337 --> 00:00:35,386
Ren: Nobody can open that cache but me.

14
00:00:36,056 --> 00:00:39,428
Ren: Seventy-two hours. Two hundred forty
kilometres.

15
00:00:41,698 --> 00:00:44,537
Ren: Twenty doors. Touch none.

16
00:00:45,207 --> 00:00:47,411
Ren: Never take the elevator on day one.

17
00:00:48,081 --> 00:00:50,417
Ren: Three at the door. They cannot see.

18
00:00:51,087 --> 00:00:52,380
Ren: They only hear.

19
00:00:53,050 --> 00:00:54,591
Ren: One step at a time.

20
00:00:55,261 --> 00:00:55,992
Ren: One.

21
00:00:57,261 --> 00:00:57,838
Ren: Two.

22
00:00:59,261 --> 00:00:59,826
Ren: Three.

23
00:01:02,861 --> 00:01:05,733
Ren: Day one. Two hundred thirty-nine to
go.

24
00:01:06,403 --> 00:01:08,224
Ren: I swore I would never kill again.

25
00:01:08,894 --> 00:01:10,921
Ren: These are not people. Are they?

26
00:01:11,591 --> 00:01:16,934
VALE & SON DISPATCH: Part one of ten, The
Quiet Hand. Next: the van. Follow for part two.

